      "½ cup green seasoning, 16 bandhania, 12 cloves garlic, hot pepper",
      "½ onion, sliced",
      "3 tablespoons minced garlic, eliminate if making fresh",
      "6 tbs extra virgin olive oil",
      "6 tablespoons curry powder",
