    "description": "Curry seafood medley, a quick, budget-friendly curry of mixed seafood with potato, optional eggplant, tomato and green seasoning. Comforting any day of the week and great with roti or rice.",
    "instructions": [
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Clean: Pick through seafood medley; remove any shells and discard. Rinse under cold water & drain."
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Heat oil in a medium pot over medium heat."
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Add onion and hot pepper and fry until golden brown."
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Add curry and cook for 3 mins. Add green seasoning, minced garlic, ½ cup water and cook until grainy and fragrant, another 3-5 minutes."
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Stir in eggplant, potatoes, tomato, thyme and cook for 10-15 mins or until tender."
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Add mixed seafood, scallions, salt, cover, reduce heat to medium low and cook for an additional 15 mins until the sauce thickens, stirring every 5 mins. Taste and add salt if required."
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Finish off with chopped scallions or bandhania also known as culantro or shado beni."
      }
    ],
