        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Put the pan in the oven directly under the broiler (about 8 inches) and cook the lamb chops for 8-10 minutes on each side for medium-well, or longer if you prefer them well-done. Make sure to keep an eye on the lamb chops while they're cooking to prevent them from burning or overcooking."
