        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Caramelize the Sugar: Turn the Instant Pot to sauté mode and add olive oil. When hot, add brown sugar and let it bubble, froth, expand, and darken. Alternately, this can be done in a pot (or the pot of the instant pot if stainless steel) on the stove to save time."
