        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Pressure Cook: Cover and set the Instant Pot to the “Meat” setting for 35-60 minutes. 35 mins worked for thin pieces of oxtail. If your oxtail pieces are larger or very large, it may require more time up to 60 minutes."
