        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Add cilantro, minced garlic, pimento peppers if using, tomatoes, couple thin slices of lemon, cayenne peppers if using, green seasoning, ½ caramelized onion and stir to combine. Cover and cook for 10 minutes."
