        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Meanwhile, boil pasta until al dente and drain. I do not add the pasta to cook directly in the same pot because I am afraid that the pasta will absorb the watery flavor from all that liquid that needs to be added to cook it. Therefore, I allow the sauce to thicken first, then add in the pasta. The pasta gets coated with the already flavorful gravy. However, feel free to do what you feel comfortable with."
