        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Using the finest side of a conventional grater, grate the cheese into a bowl. Mix in the remaining ingredients to your desired taste. Alternatively, place all of the ingredients into a food processor and pulse until evenly combined. If it is too thick, add more milk or mayo to achieve a smooth, spreadable texture."
