        "text": "In a large heavy bottomed pot over medium heat, heat oil and add brown sugar. Once the sugar bubbles, froths and darkens evenly, add meat(reserve marinating liquid if any), raise heat to high and turn frequently to coat. Cook 3-5 minutes, stirring. Reduce heat to low, cover and cook for 30-45 minutes until meat softens."
