        "text": "Cook the Chickpeas: Place the soaked chickpeas in an Instant Pot along with 6 cups of water, 1-2 teaspoons of turmeric powder, 5 teaspoons of salt(or to taste), and half of the prepared seasonings. Select beans - 20 minutes."
