        "text": "Remove cover, mash about ½ of the potatoes and any large pieces with the back of the spoon. Cover the pot and cook an additional 5 minutes, or until the potatoes are fully cooked and the sauce has thickened slightly. Feel free to add more water to create as much sauce as you like. Keep in mind that it thickens as it cools."
