        "text": "Step 5: Steam the Fish: Gently place the marinated fish into the simmering sauce. Lower the heat and cook for 10 minutes or until the fish flakes easily with a fork. Baste the fish occasionally with the sauce to enhance its flavor. Adjust seasoning to taste."
